The '''marble gargoyle''' is a [[superior]] variant of the [[gargoyle]]. It has a chance of spawning after purchasing the unlock ''Bigger and Badder'' for 50 [[Slayer reward point]]s from any [[Slayer master]].

Unlike most other superior monsters, marble gargoyles use two combat styles: melee and ranged. Both its standard attacks can hit very high, though they are somewhat inaccurate. Players should [[Protect from Missiles]] to take the least damage unless wearing equipment with high ranged defence. Attacking from a distance with Protect from Missiles and a magic or ranged weapon negates all damage, excluding the special attack. 

In combat, the marble gargoyle will occasionally launch a grey ball towards the player. If hit by the projectile (magic), it will inflict up to 38 damage and [[Freeze|immobilise]] the player for a few seconds. The message box states "''You have been trapped in stone!''" when this occurs. Players are able to avoid this attack by moving at least one [[Game square|tile]] away from their original position once the projectile is launched. It is possible for nearby gargoyles to attack the player until the marble gargoyle uses melee or ranged.

[[File:Marble gargoyle special attack.png|thumb|right|250px|A marble gargoyle fires its special attack.]]

